  "type": "Article",
  "name": "Photo Series: Standout",
  "summary": "\u003cp\u003eStandout is a short series of shots taken in Switzerland between March 2021 and\nMay 2024. They are photos showing telephone poles, electricity pylons,\nsignposts, and fence posts standing out.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/19106/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/19106/19106.avif\"\n         title=\"Standout 01\"\n         alt=\"A telephone pole with a second angled support pole in front of a white sky in a field with a patch of snow in the background, black and white.\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"19106\" loading=\"eager\"  fetchpriority=\"high\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e",
  "content": "\u003cp\u003eStandout is a short series of shots taken in Switzerland between March 2021 and\nMay 2024. They are photos showing telephone poles, electricity pylons,\nsignposts, and fence posts standing out.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/19106/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/19106/19106.avif\"\n         title=\"Standout 01\"\n         alt=\"A telephone pole with a second angled support pole in front of a white sky in a field with a patch of snow in the background, black and white.\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"19106\" loading=\"eager\"  fetchpriority=\"high\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/23510/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/23510/23510.avif\"\n         title=\"Standout 02\"\n         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t height=\"999\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"23510\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/20301/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/20301/20301.avif\"\n         title=\"Standout 03\"\n         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t height=\"999\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"20301\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/23402/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/23402/23402.avif\"\n         title=\"Standout 04\"\n         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"23402\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/19504/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/19504/19504.avif\"\n         title=\"Standout 05\"\n         alt=\"In the foreground, a road sign seen from behind at the crossroads of two gravel tracks. A flat field extends behind with pylons and wires above, and some farm buildings behind. Beyond that a partially snow covered mountain, black and white.\"\n\t\t height=\"997\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"19504\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/23503/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/23503/23503.avif\"\n         title=\"Standout 06\"\n         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t height=\"999\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"23503\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/19105/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/19105/19105.avif\"\n         title=\"Standout 07\"\n         alt=\"A grassy hill with odd fence posts starting in the front left and extending rightwards and into the distance, black and white.\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"19105\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/23504/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/23504/23504.avif\"\n         title=\"Standout 08\"\n         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t height=\"999\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"23504\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/23509/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/23509/23509.avif\"\n         title=\"Standout 09\"\n         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t height=\"999\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"23509\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eEvery photo in the series was shot on my Hasselblad 501c with either a 60mm\nf/3.5 CF or 80mm f/2.8 CB lens using Ilford HP5+ shot at ISO 800 and developed\nin Ilfotec HC 1:49 for 11 minutes. I scanned them with an Epson V800 and edited\nthem in darktable.\u003c/p\u003e",
  "url": "https://samsm.ch/standout/",
  "published": "2025-07-20T00:00:00Z",
